{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-gingerbread-figures-sold-by-blue-diamond-garden-centres-2511-0174","content_id":"ce8ce78f-6da2-41e8-80e2-c52cb6009921","description":"Product Recall for Gingerbread Figures presenting a choking risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"d6ef11fb-843e-49fd-a3df-94e1381bd38f","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-11-26T09:26:50+00:00","id":"d6ef11fb-843e-49fd-a3df-94e1381bd38f","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-11-26T09:26:50+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6926c7dab3b9afff34e95fe7/2511-0174-product-recall-gingerbread-short-legs-model_BD220743AB.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Gingerbread Figures</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of choking due to detachable small parts.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Decorative articles – Seasonal Decorations (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Xiamen Amoydecor Ind Co Ltd</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Models</td>\n      <td>Standing Gingerbread with Telescopic Legs, Sitting Gingerbread with Short Legs, Gingerbread On Stick, Sitting Gingerbread with Dangle Legs</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Codes</td>\n      <td>BD220743AB, BD220741AB, BD240451AB1, BD220739AB</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcodes</td>\n      <td>2099005912119, 2099005912102, 2099006029465, 2099005912096</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Range of gingerbread decorative figures.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_d6ef11fb-843e-49fd-a3df-94e1381bd38f\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6926c7dab3b9afff34e95fe7/2511-0174-product-recall-gingerbread-short-legs-model_BD220743AB.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The Sitting Gingerbread with Short Legs model presents risk of choking as testing identified small components that can detach or break off during reasonably foreseeable use, creating parts that fit entirely within a small parts cylinder. These small parts pose a choking hazard to young children, particularly those under 36 months of age who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in their mouths. The product also has gaps in the seams, which may allow access to the fibrous internal stuffing.\nBlue Diamond are therefore recalling all models of Gingerbread Figures sold in their stores.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products are being recalled from end users by Blue Diamond.</p>\n\n<p>Consumers should stop using the products immediately and return them to the nearest store for a full refund or exchange. For more information, please see: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.bluediamond.gg/files/files/christmas-gingerbread-family-product-recall-6908b8d25ce3f.pdf\">Blue Diamond Recall</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0174</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-26T09:31:54Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"household-decorative-articles","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-11-26","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-11-26T09:31:54+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-gingerbread-figures-sold-by-blue-diamond-garden-centres-2511-0174","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-gingerbread-figures-sold-by-blue-diamond-garden-centres-2511-0174","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-gingerbread-figures-sold-by-blue-diamond-garden-centres-2511-0174","content_id":"ce8ce78f-6da2-41e8-80e2-c52cb6009921","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-11-26T09:31:54Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Gingerbread Figures sold by Blue Diamond Garden Centres (2511-0174)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-gingerbread-figures-sold-by-blue-diamond-garden-centres-2511-0174","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"p